e hellboy certainly has its horror  elements it's more aspiring to be the  same kind of beast as deadpool  playing as a crowd-pleasing  four-quadrant blockbuster with some  blood and guts and naughty words  that's what the movie sold itself as but  a sea cinema score suggests that people  did not get what they wanted out of  hellboy whether it was too gory too  confusing or just too weird  it also suggests that people won't be  running to tell their friends to go see  it either  meaning any hopes of the movie picking  up speed in the weeks after its debut  are pretty low especially with the  avengers right around the corner  at that point it's curtains for all  hellboy in hindsight they probably  should have just let guimo finish as  trilogy  it couldn't have turned out much worse  than this check out one of our newest  videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

